1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Remember putting one of these in your PC?

2
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:05,680
That's the GeForce 256, from 1999.

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:09,060
Nvidia's board brought Jensen Huang back as CEO.

4
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:11,260
How many of those are in a new one?

5
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:13,360
We're counting transistors, not speed.

6
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,380
That card had up to 23 million transistors.

7
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:20,030
The RTX 5090 has about 92 billion.

8
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:20,980
Divide them.

9
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,480
More than 4,000.

10
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:24,480
Four thousand of these in one of those?

11
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:27,160
That whole wall, in transistors, is one chip.

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,800
Subscribe and count with us.
